WEBVTT

00:07.240 --> 00:10.990
<i>The students of the Misfit Class 
were given a task.</i>

00:11.360 --> 00:16.580
<i>If they do not all advance to the 
Dalet rank before their second year,</i>

00:16.580 --> 00:22.600
<i>they will be kicked out of the Royal One, 
which they worked so hard to acquire.</i>

00:22.600 --> 00:26.340
<i>Iruma and his friends must attempt 
the rank-advancement exams.</i>

00:26.660 --> 00:29.960
<i>First up... The Harvest Festival!</i>

02:03.010 --> 02:07.520
<b>Legend Leaf</b>

02:03.400 --> 02:05.290
"Legend Leaf."

02:07.520 --> 02:08.980
<b>Day 4</b>

02:08.980 --> 02:12.770
<b>The Final Day</b>

02:13.920 --> 02:17.260
Okay, the Harvest Festival's coming to an end!

02:17.260 --> 02:19.520
Wow! Isn't it exciting?!

02:19.880 --> 02:22.400
Whatever you have in your possession

02:22.400 --> 02:27.040
when the Harvest Festival ends will 
be added to your final point total,

02:27.040 --> 02:29.550
but no more harvesting after time expires!

02:29.550 --> 02:31.240
Bzzt!

02:31.240 --> 02:33.920
And Balam-sensei will 
definitely be checking!

02:34.180 --> 02:38.630
<i>Well? Do you all have your final goods?</i>

02:39.880 --> 02:43.560
Wow, the Seed of Beginnings 
and Vase of Endings.

02:42.800 --> 02:45.710
We did combine them, but...

02:43.560 --> 02:45.710
Just fitting good!

02:45.710 --> 02:48.050
I don't think it turned out quite right.

02:48.050 --> 02:49.870
It's kind of surreal.

02:49.870 --> 02:54.490
I felt sure that just bringing them together 
would make the Legend Leaf bloom.

02:54.490 --> 02:56.690
How do we actually get it to?

02:58.070 --> 02:59.820
I know!

02:59.820 --> 03:01.320
Know what?

03:01.320 --> 03:02.890
Think about it!

03:02.890 --> 03:04.720
The person overseeing 
the Harvest Festival...

03:04.720 --> 03:07.940
The one who created this forest 
was Suzie-sensei, right?!

03:07.940 --> 03:08.830
Yis!

03:09.830 --> 03:13.830
And this festival is the
first-years' final evaluation,

03:14.120 --> 03:16.570
where we put to use everything 
we learned all year!

03:17.330 --> 03:21.350
Based on all that, I know 
what we have to remember...

03:22.080 --> 03:24.600
Suzie-sensei's first class!

03:26.370 --> 03:30.840
Today, let us use magic to try to
make some flowers bloom, shall we?

03:30.840 --> 03:31.640
Yis!

03:32.260 --> 03:36.270
Hold your hand over this 
special sapling, and...

03:36.270 --> 03:37.940
Quan Quan.

03:37.940 --> 03:39.060
Iruma-chi!

03:39.060 --> 03:39.730
Right!

03:39.730 --> 03:43.660
The answer was inside us all along.

03:49.130 --> 03:50.160
Gulp!

03:54.360 --> 03:57.920
I'm going to make you bloom, Legend Leaf!

03:58.970 --> 04:00.430
Quan Quan!

04:17.560 --> 04:19.210
Guess I was wrong!

04:19.210 --> 04:21.830
Huh?! Y-Yeah, guess you were!

04:22.020 --> 04:24.410
What's the key, then?!

04:24.410 --> 04:27.830
The Harvest Festival's almost over!

04:26.630 --> 04:27.830
S'all good!

04:28.300 --> 04:30.360
There's nothing in the song about it...

04:30.360 --> 04:31.320
What do we do?

04:31.330 --> 04:32.710
<b>Fsssh</b>

04:32.710 --> 04:34.960
Naphula-san! What are you doing?!

04:37.960 --> 04:39.460
The seed...

04:44.420 --> 04:45.630
Now?!

04:45.630 --> 04:47.000
Do it now, you mean?

04:47.000 --> 04:48.340
P-Probably!

04:49.340 --> 04:51.050
Quan Quan!

05:07.860 --> 05:08.930
So close!

05:08.930 --> 05:10.740
We're missing something.

05:11.250 --> 05:13.630
Not enough mana?!

05:13.630 --> 05:15.790
I just don't get it!

05:16.970 --> 05:19.080
<i>What about Ifrit mode?</i>

05:19.590 --> 05:21.150
Not happening!

05:21.150 --> 05:22.090
Ali-san?!

05:22.090 --> 05:24.240
I'm at my limit.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.580
Totally out of mana.

05:26.580 --> 05:30.190
I'll disappear if you use me any more!

05:30.190 --> 05:32.140
No way!

05:32.140 --> 05:33.320
At my limit...

05:33.320 --> 05:34.560
Keep it up!

05:34.560 --> 05:38.810
There's a demon nearby with lots 
and lots of magic power...

05:38.810 --> 05:41.800
If I could borrow a little from them...

05:41.800 --> 05:44.560
Y-You think they'll just let us...

05:46.880 --> 05:49.820
Iruma-chi, you okay?

05:50.700 --> 05:53.070
Oh, there they are.

05:53.520 --> 05:56.040
<i>Over the course of the Harvest Festival,</i>

05:56.040 --> 05:59.280
<i>Clara has played merrily 
with many magical beasts,</i>

05:59.280 --> 06:01.960
<i>allowing her to absorb 
a great deal of mana.</i>

05:59.330 --> 06:01.960
*She's pretty unaware of this

06:02.200 --> 06:05.390
Li'l Iru! Take Clara-rin's hand!

06:05.960 --> 06:07.460
Clara!

06:07.460 --> 06:09.660
Lend me your power!

06:10.580 --> 06:11.550
Okay!

06:17.900 --> 06:18.800
Here we go!

06:18.800 --> 06:19.890
One, two...

06:20.080 --> 06:21.800
Quan Quan!

06:33.820 --> 06:34.830
Is it you?

06:38.410 --> 06:39.590
...ruma-kun!

06:39.590 --> 06:40.880
Iruma-kun!

06:41.330 --> 06:42.570
Iruma-kun?!

06:42.800 --> 06:44.300
L-Lead-kun?

06:45.200 --> 06:47.280
What's with all the smoke?

06:47.280 --> 06:49.100
Actually, though...

06:49.100 --> 06:51.100
Where's the Legend Leaf?!

06:58.420 --> 07:01.160
<i>Time is up!</i>

07:01.160 --> 07:04.120
<i>The 6,666 minutes have expired!</i>

07:04.120 --> 07:07.120
<i>The Harvest Festival is officially over!</i>

07:09.070 --> 07:12.110
<i>Everyone gather back at the starting point!</i>

07:12.710 --> 07:14.320
So tired!

07:14.320 --> 07:15.610
It's finally over!

07:15.610 --> 07:17.060
Four days is a long time!

07:17.060 --> 07:18.620
I bet that's worth a ton of points!

07:19.430 --> 07:21.080
Finally over.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.620
I can't move another muscle.

07:22.620 --> 07:25.120
It was hard, but lots of fun!

07:30.510 --> 07:32.380
Great work, all!

07:32.380 --> 07:35.120
We're tallying up the points right now!

07:35.120 --> 07:36.910
Great work out there!

07:36.910 --> 07:38.390
There, there, kiddo.

07:40.640 --> 07:42.390
Hey! Look at that!

07:43.050 --> 07:44.880
It's the Misfit Class!

07:44.880 --> 07:47.150
Dang, they look intense!

08:01.430 --> 08:03.540
He's too heavy...

08:07.040 --> 08:09.420
Do you think those two will be here?

08:10.370 --> 08:11.680
You know the answer to that.

08:12.030 --> 08:15.190
It's in clutch moments like these
when they exceed expectations.

08:15.680 --> 08:20.530
As expected, he's going to 
harvest the Legend Leaf

08:20.530 --> 08:21.600
and return.

08:21.600 --> 08:23.440
It's Iruma and Lead!

08:25.440 --> 08:27.050
They've got something!

08:27.050 --> 08:27.890
Can it be...

08:27.890 --> 08:29.150
Iruma-san?!

08:30.100 --> 08:32.300
I'm so glad you're safe!

08:32.300 --> 08:34.360
I thought you couldn't move.

08:34.360 --> 08:36.360
It's worth 100,000 points...

08:36.360 --> 08:38.000
The Legend Leaf!

08:40.880 --> 08:42.870
<i>Not what I expected!</i>

08:42.870 --> 08:44.240
That's the Legend Leaf?

08:44.240 --> 08:45.310
That thing?

08:45.310 --> 08:45.990
No way!

08:45.990 --> 08:46.870
What the heck?

08:46.870 --> 08:50.640
We definitely returned 
with confidence, but...

08:50.640 --> 08:52.160
There's no hiding it.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.580
Lots of gossip, yes.

08:53.580 --> 08:54.620
But...

08:54.910 --> 08:56.920
We just have to submit it!

08:57.390 --> 08:59.050
Clear the way, clear the way!

08:59.820 --> 09:01.890
Just as documented!

09:01.890 --> 09:04.850
That doofy shape and irritating expression...

09:04.850 --> 09:06.060
There's no question!

09:06.060 --> 09:11.320
It's a genuine Legend Leaf!

09:11.320 --> 09:14.060
What?!

09:17.320 --> 09:19.630
B-But if it's real...

09:19.630 --> 09:20.330
Yeah.

09:21.570 --> 09:24.400
That's 100,000 points for us!

09:24.400 --> 09:26.080
Yeah!

09:26.080 --> 09:28.080
Yeah!

09:28.080 --> 09:29.240
We did it!

09:29.240 --> 09:30.590
That's so awesome!

09:30.590 --> 09:31.980
Impressive as ever!

09:31.980 --> 09:33.960
You've slain me yet again, Iruma-sama!

09:33.960 --> 09:35.960
Azz-kun! Thank you!

09:36.200 --> 09:38.130
I like how it feels.

09:38.130 --> 09:41.040
I never thought I'd really get to see one!

09:41.040 --> 09:43.360
What a historic achievement!

09:43.800 --> 09:45.980
How are you going to split up the points?

09:45.980 --> 09:47.400
Um...

09:47.400 --> 09:48.980
We didn't think about that.

09:48.980 --> 09:51.810
Hello! We don't need points!

09:52.420 --> 09:53.240
Huh?!

09:53.240 --> 09:54.730
Y-You're sure?

09:54.730 --> 09:57.020
We want you guys to win!

09:57.020 --> 09:59.910
Besides, all I did was go "bwah!" at the end.

10:01.140 --> 10:03.740
Gyo-chan agrees! I think!

10:03.740 --> 10:06.750
Clara, Naphula-san, thank you!

10:08.240 --> 10:10.390
It's decided, then!

10:10.390 --> 10:14.010
Iruma and Lead both get 50,000 points!

10:17.020 --> 10:20.270
Incredible! They'll win it for sure, then!

10:20.270 --> 10:22.410
Iruma-san!

10:22.410 --> 10:25.520
You can cry or take pictures. Not both.

10:25.520 --> 10:26.770
Okay, all!

10:26.770 --> 10:28.520
Let's announce the placements!

10:28.520 --> 10:31.280
The winners are Iruma and Lead!

10:34.690 --> 10:39.740
<b><i>I'm gonna 
win for
 sure!</i></b>

10:40.780 --> 10:43.780
<b>Ranking Ceremony</b>

10:50.790 --> 10:53.150
They all worked very hard, didn't they?

10:53.150 --> 10:54.800
Yes, it was impressive.

10:59.170 --> 11:01.060
President, I believe it's time.

11:01.060 --> 11:03.520
Who will be the Young King this year?

11:03.520 --> 11:04.990
I can't wait to find out!

11:04.990 --> 11:06.000
Indeed.

11:10.930 --> 11:14.270
The Harvest Festival's ranking 
ceremony is about to commence.

11:14.700 --> 11:16.140
Don't you want to see it?

11:16.140 --> 11:17.440
Yes, but...

11:17.440 --> 11:20.090
I'm so devi excited...

11:22.460 --> 11:24.710
As am I.

11:24.710 --> 11:27.440
Yes, yes! I'm sure you are!

11:32.370 --> 11:35.190
Okay, let's get announcing!

11:35.190 --> 11:37.800
The winner of this year's 
Harvest Festival is...

11:36.920 --> 11:37.800
Calculating

11:49.970 --> 11:51.320
Please...

11:56.860 --> 11:58.110
Calculating

11:58.110 --> 12:02.110
<b>Orobas Coco</b>

11:58.110 --> 12:02.110
<b>Iruma</b>

11:58.110 --> 12:02.110
<b>Shax Lead</b>

11:58.110 --> 12:02.110
m 0 0 l 170 0 170 40 0 40

11:58.110 --> 12:02.110
m 0 0 l 170 0 170 40 0 40

11:58.110 --> 12:02.110
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 40 0 40

11:58.640 --> 12:02.110
The winner is... Orobas Coco!

12:06.380 --> 12:08.840
He scored 58,000 points!

12:12.330 --> 12:14.580
58,000?!

12:14.580 --> 12:16.040
Orobas-kun...

12:15.320 --> 12:16.930
Eiko...

12:16.040 --> 12:16.940
No way...

12:16.940 --> 12:18.590
But he's always second...

12:18.590 --> 12:20.060
That's devi amazing!

12:20.060 --> 12:22.090
So many rare food items!

12:22.090 --> 12:23.610
Yis!

12:26.100 --> 12:28.160
What a pity.

12:35.850 --> 12:37.110
President...

12:37.890 --> 12:39.850
He is this year's Young King.

12:47.910 --> 12:50.870
<b>Orobas Coco</b>

12:47.910 --> 12:50.870
<b>Iruma</b>

12:47.910 --> 12:50.870
<b>Shax Lead</b>

12:55.620 --> 12:58.140
<b>Orobas Coco</b>

12:58.140 --> 12:59.690
<i>First.</i>

12:59.690 --> 13:02.270
<i>I'm first. I've only ever dreamed about it...</i>

13:02.920 --> 13:04.200
<i>To win.</i>

13:04.790 --> 13:09.280
<i>And yet... why does it 
feel so unsatisfying?</i>

13:09.890 --> 13:12.730
<i>I won fair and square...</i>

13:13.100 --> 13:14.600
<i>Didn't I?</i>

13:14.940 --> 13:16.340
<i>But did I?</i>

13:16.720 --> 13:18.890
<i>Something feels wrong.</i>

13:19.210 --> 13:22.390
<i>Is this the feeling I was seeking?</i>

13:22.390 --> 13:25.300
<i>It feels like a haze over my heart.</i>

13:25.900 --> 13:29.920
<i>Is this truly acceptable?</i>

13:30.330 --> 13:33.190
<i>Me? The Young King?</i>

13:37.350 --> 13:41.290
<i>At first, I just wanted Master's approval.</i>

13:42.100 --> 13:43.470
<i>That's why I worked hard.</i>

13:43.770 --> 13:46.120
<i>I managed to do well at archery,</i>

13:46.560 --> 13:49.350
<i>and I made the Legend Leaf bloom, but...</i>

13:53.060 --> 13:56.390
<i>Is this what it feels like you're 
just not good enough?</i>

13:57.520 --> 14:00.970
<i>I wanted... to win!</i>

14:02.700 --> 14:04.650
Objection!

14:14.790 --> 14:18.000
You know, I've been thinking 
about this carefully...

14:18.000 --> 14:20.290
And the calculation's gotta be off.

14:20.290 --> 14:21.670
The calculation?

14:21.670 --> 14:22.710
Yeah.

14:22.710 --> 14:25.690
The Legend Leaf splits to 50,000 each,

14:25.690 --> 14:27.420
but didn't you forget something?

14:27.420 --> 14:29.800
100,000

14:27.420 --> 14:31.920
The Vase of Endings is worth 
20,000 on its own, right?

14:30.050 --> 14:31.930
20,000

14:33.490 --> 14:34.180
Ah.

14:36.180 --> 14:38.690
That's right! We all heard 
that announcement!

14:39.340 --> 14:40.190
President.

14:40.560 --> 14:42.190
Which means...

14:42.190 --> 14:44.920
D-Do excuse me!

14:44.920 --> 14:49.200
It's our first Legend Leaf, 
so we just assumed it was 100,000!

14:51.200 --> 14:52.540
Eiko.

14:54.760 --> 14:56.450
She's bawling!

15:01.080 --> 15:02.960
20,000 split in half...

15:02.960 --> 15:05.090
That's 10,000 each.

15:05.360 --> 15:08.650
Which means...

15:15.080 --> 15:16.840
With 60,000 points,

15:16.840 --> 15:20.360
Iruma and Lead come back for the win!

15:17.390 --> 15:20.350
<b>Iruma</b>

15:17.390 --> 15:20.350
<b>Shax Lead</b>

15:17.390 --> 15:20.350
<b>Orobas Coco</b>

15:17.390 --> 15:20.350
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 40 0 40

15:17.390 --> 15:20.350
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 40 0 40

15:17.390 --> 15:20.350
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 40 0 40

15:23.350 --> 15:25.630
W-We win?

15:28.110 --> 15:30.450
Iruma-chi! Congrats!

15:30.450 --> 15:31.470
Iruma-sama!

15:31.470 --> 15:33.010
Congratulations to you!

15:33.010 --> 15:35.120
Thanks a bunch, Clara! Azz-kun!

15:35.120 --> 15:37.640
Jazzy! You rock!

15:37.640 --> 15:39.500
H-Hey, cut it out!

15:39.740 --> 15:41.500
Jumping for joy!

15:41.500 --> 15:43.000
Isn't that nice?

15:43.000 --> 15:45.000
Something amazing has happened!

15:45.000 --> 15:47.000
Shut up already!

15:48.530 --> 15:51.720
I'm so glad Iruma-san won!

15:51.720 --> 15:54.510
C-Congratulations!

15:56.760 --> 16:00.260
<i>Third place. I didn't win.</i>

16:03.180 --> 16:04.880
<i>I'm not second, either.</i>

16:07.130 --> 16:08.760
<i>I didn't win.</i>

16:10.180 --> 16:11.850
<i>Yet I feel so refreshed!</i>

16:14.110 --> 16:18.110
<i>I see now why I was so 
fixated on the Misfit Class.</i>

16:18.860 --> 16:20.980
<i>As I'm always second place...</i>

16:20.980 --> 16:26.920
<i>I always envied and resented 
those who always took first.</i>

16:27.720 --> 16:29.530
<i>But more than that...</i>

16:30.420 --> 16:32.910
<i>I admired them!</i>

16:33.550 --> 16:37.780
<i>Those absurd, amazing demons...</i>

16:39.430 --> 16:41.450
Congrats!

16:40.180 --> 16:43.610
Congratulations, Iruma-sama! You did it!

16:40.260 --> 16:42.680
Thanks! Yahoo!

16:41.450 --> 16:42.680
Great job!

16:42.680 --> 16:44.480
Thank you all!

16:42.680 --> 16:44.640
No one can stop us now!

16:54.200 --> 16:57.220
Allow me to apologize for everything.

16:57.220 --> 16:58.200
Huh?

16:58.200 --> 17:01.280
My obsession with victory caused me

17:01.280 --> 17:04.560
to forget everything and 
lose touch with myself.

17:04.560 --> 17:08.650
I lost sight of all reason.

17:08.650 --> 17:10.710
I truly am sorry.

17:13.490 --> 17:14.450
It's okay.

17:16.340 --> 17:20.030
It's a sign you were really 
giving it your all, right?

17:20.030 --> 17:22.620
We gave it our all, too.

17:22.620 --> 17:24.190
Yeah, yeah!

17:24.190 --> 17:26.960
And it's not like you broke any rules.

17:26.960 --> 17:30.090
And Jazzy got revenge for us, so...

17:30.090 --> 17:34.800
Your illusion magic was 
incredible! So strong!

17:35.360 --> 17:36.640
No regrets!

17:36.640 --> 17:37.610
Stop that!

17:37.900 --> 17:39.350
Hey, Orobas!

17:39.350 --> 17:40.880
Third place is amazing!

17:40.880 --> 17:42.230
My heart was pounding the whole time!

17:42.230 --> 17:43.800
You almost got there!

17:43.800 --> 17:45.980
And you didn't get second. Too bad.

17:45.980 --> 17:48.040
Well, I don't have to be second...

17:48.040 --> 17:50.940
Aw, c'mon. Don't hold it in.

17:50.940 --> 17:52.620
But I mean it...

17:52.620 --> 17:54.130
What, really?!

17:54.130 --> 17:57.180
What, he's just that amazing, then?

17:57.180 --> 17:58.760
Sorry we were scared of you!

17:58.760 --> 18:00.660
Let's hit up the after-party together!

18:00.660 --> 18:02.140
R-Right...

18:02.140 --> 18:05.010
Who was it that said he was 
part of the Second Faith?

18:05.010 --> 18:06.400
Orobas-kun, you're awesome!

18:05.480 --> 18:08.140
It was devi amazing, though!

18:08.140 --> 18:11.440
Hey, <i>we're</i> the Young Kings.

18:12.410 --> 18:13.640
Iruma.

18:13.640 --> 18:14.940
Ameri-san!

18:14.940 --> 18:16.050
Lady Redhair!

18:16.660 --> 18:18.120
Come on now, President.

18:18.120 --> 18:19.600
R-Right.

18:20.920 --> 18:23.730
You've exceeded my expectations once more.

18:23.730 --> 18:25.420
You're incredible, Iruma.

18:25.800 --> 18:27.320
You truly are ama—

18:27.960 --> 18:29.210
Very impressive.

18:29.210 --> 18:32.400
But, you know... Well, that is...

18:32.400 --> 18:34.800
Do you have anything for me?

18:34.800 --> 18:38.830
So maybe he'll bring you 
a Legend Leaf bouquet.

18:40.210 --> 18:41.860
<i>It's totally possible!</i>

18:41.860 --> 18:42.990
Ameri-san...

18:42.990 --> 18:45.760
I just wanted to see you smile.

18:48.530 --> 18:49.820
Naphu?

18:50.150 --> 18:50.760
Indeed.

18:50.760 --> 18:52.780
Well done, Naphula.

18:52.780 --> 18:54.150
You know each other?

18:54.150 --> 18:56.650
Yes. You didn't know?

18:59.450 --> 19:01.270
Ampsy Naphula.

19:01.270 --> 19:05.570
The first-year student council 
official I recently scouted.

19:05.570 --> 19:07.310
S-Student council?!

19:07.310 --> 19:08.260
Yis.

19:08.260 --> 19:13.780
We had Naphula-san participate in the 
Harvest Festival on the administration side!

19:13.780 --> 19:16.240
Of course, we didn't tell you about it!

19:17.840 --> 19:21.680
<i>Yes, Naphula was one of the 
requirements for getting the Leaf.</i>

19:21.680 --> 19:25.490
<i>If you don't save Naphula and 
get the Rainbow Watering Can,</i>

19:23.090 --> 19:27.520
 Rainbow Watering Can

19:25.490 --> 19:27.350
<i>you can't make the Leaf bloom.</i>

19:27.680 --> 19:30.160
It's a secret rule the school decided on!

19:30.160 --> 19:33.190
We have one person help every year!

19:33.190 --> 19:35.090
Mission complete!

19:35.450 --> 19:37.690
I had no idea.

19:37.690 --> 19:39.300
What a pain.

19:39.300 --> 19:41.670
A real nasty condition, right?

19:41.670 --> 19:43.450
Yeah, true.

19:43.720 --> 19:45.700
Oh, hello there!

19:50.710 --> 19:52.330
The Leaf is talking!

19:55.640 --> 19:58.710
What? It's talking?

19:58.710 --> 20:01.300
Allow me to explain!

20:01.300 --> 20:04.280
Could the winners come up to me?

20:04.280 --> 20:05.720
S-So casual...

20:05.720 --> 20:06.960
But it's a "Legend"...

20:06.960 --> 20:08.880
He's actually kinda cute!

20:08.880 --> 20:10.480
Cute?

20:10.480 --> 20:15.180
Well, I didn't think anyone 
would ever harvest me,

20:15.180 --> 20:17.640
so I'm kinda made of vibes...

20:17.640 --> 20:18.730
Vibes?

20:18.730 --> 20:21.770
The conditions for making me bloom:

20:18.730 --> 20:22.900
<b>Song Interpretation</b>

20:21.770 --> 20:24.160
Decipher the song, the seed trial,

20:22.780 --> 20:23.860
An Interesting Story

20:22.780 --> 20:23.910
<b>Seed Trial</b>

20:23.780 --> 20:25.070
<b>Save Naphula</b>

20:24.160 --> 20:26.440
save Naphula, the vase trial,

20:25.110 --> 20:26.200
<b>Vase Trial</b>

20:26.090 --> 20:26.890
<b>Combination</b>

20:26.440 --> 20:30.470
the combination, and then the Quan Quan 
with super amounts of mana!

20:26.740 --> 20:30.330
<b>Quan Quan with Super Amounts of Mana</b>

20:30.290 --> 20:32.000
<b>Complete!!</b>

20:32.000 --> 20:34.850
It's all pretty stupid, right?

20:34.850 --> 20:36.000
Don't laugh!

20:36.000 --> 20:38.740
I can't believe we made this thing bloom...

20:38.740 --> 20:42.880
But the feelings put into 
this process are truly simple.

20:43.240 --> 20:45.410
To not be led astray by easy gain.

20:45.410 --> 20:46.830
To care about others.

20:46.830 --> 20:48.520
To enjoy the absurd.

20:48.520 --> 20:50.640
To follow one's own desires.

20:50.640 --> 20:54.680
To continue to try tirelessly 
and never give up.

20:54.680 --> 20:56.090
It is...

20:56.090 --> 21:00.280
I want to meet the least 
demonish demon of them all.

21:01.080 --> 21:02.080
Is it you?

21:02.080 --> 21:04.200
H-Hey. Was that...

21:04.550 --> 21:07.250
Welp, that's the whole explanation,

21:07.250 --> 21:10.200
so I guess I'd better put 
on the finishing touch!

21:12.680 --> 21:13.620
Yis!

21:13.970 --> 21:14.800
He's flying!

21:14.800 --> 21:16.620
F-Finishing touch?!

21:22.640 --> 21:26.810
Well fought, my young demons!

21:26.810 --> 21:29.900
In celebration of the new Young King,

21:29.900 --> 21:33.600
I bestow upon you all a great reward!

21:35.270 --> 21:37.520
Behold!

21:37.520 --> 21:42.720
The flower never before seen 
in the demon world!

23:32.010 --> 23:35.180
<b>Su</b>

23:32.760 --> 23:35.180
<b>Ki</b>

23:33.510 --> 23:35.180
<b>Ma</b>

23:33.610 --> 23:34.710
Su-ki-ma!

23:36.920 --> 23:40.280
Iruma-san! I'm so glad you won!

23:40.970 --> 23:43.000
Congrats!

23:43.000 --> 23:45.270
She's devi bawling!

