The "Congrats on Surviving 
the Harvest Festival List," eh?

23:54.490 --> 23:59.500
<b>Eiko</b>

23:54.490 --> 23:59.500
<b>Gaako</b>

23:54.840 --> 23:55.990
Well done...

23:56.720 --> 24:01.040
<i>Eiko cunningly managed 
to survive to the last day.</i>

